      "body": "'S0A.RV' BIND S0A.RV 1 DROP S0A.RV 0 GET 1 2 COLLECT 1 COLLECT [ 'S0A.RE' BIND 'S0A.RA' BIND S0A.RA S0A.RA LENGTH 1 SUB S0A.RE S0A.RA -1 GET 1 GET 1 ADD 2 COLLECT PUT S0A.RA S0A.RE 1 2 COLLECT 1 COLLECT CONCAT S0A.RA -1 GET 0 GET S0A.RE EQ S0A.IF ] FOLD",
