      "body": "'S0A.UV' BIND S0A.UV 1 DROP S0A.UV -1 DROP GT 1 [ 'S0A.UB' BIND 'S0A.UC' BIND S0A.UC 1 ADD 1 S0A.UB SELECT ] SCAN 1 [ MAX ] FOLD",
