      "body": "'S0A.DV' BIND S0A.DV 1 DROP S0A.DV 0 GET 1 COLLECT [ 'S0A.DE' BIND 'S0A.DA' BIND S0A.DA S0A.DA S0A.DE 1 COLLECT CONCAT S0A.DA -1 GET S0A.DE EQ S0A.IF ] FOLD",
